    "Primer, les muralles. Poses el rei a recer aviat, no regales res i esperes que l'altre s'equivoqui.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walls first. You tuck your king away early, give nothing away and wait for the other side to slip."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primero, las murallas. Pones al rey a salvo pronto, no regalas nada y esperas a que el otro se equivoque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Problemes de partides reals, a la teva mida. Els que se t'escapen tornen més endavant.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Problems from real games, at your level. The ones that get away come back later."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
